# Reproducible checkouts on every operating system.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the UI assets
# to CRLF.  The Node-driven UI tests patch those exact files, and their
# "strip the bootstrap IIFE" regex matches a bare LF, so the suite failed on
# Windows for a reason that had nothing to do with the code under test.  A
# release built from such a checkout would also ship different bytes than the
# reviewed commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsm binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
